{"route":"/docs/6.0/forms/switch/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Switch","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Custom toggle component built on top of native <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> checkbox elements."},"blocks":[{"id":"basic-switch","type":"heading","en":"Basic switch","level":2},{"id":"basic-switch--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Switches work by layering an invisible checkbox over the custom switch indicator. This preserves interactivity while giving you a completely customizable layer underneath. Switches also include the <code>switch</code> attribute for browsers that support it, which provides haptic feedback when toggling."},{"id":"basic-switch--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e1c722c4d2555c6841a9","height":147,"anchors":["switch"]},{"id":"basic-switch--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"switch\">\n  <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switch\" role=\"switch\" switch>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"with-form-field","type":"heading","en":"With form field","level":2},{"id":"with-form-field--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap the <code>.switch</code> in a <code>.form-field</code> layout wrapper and add your label. The grid layout places the switch and label side by side."},{"id":"with-form-field--example-1","type":"demo","key":"675800f1061b42b027b3","height":147,"anchors":["switchMdLabel"]},{"id":"with-form-field--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchMdLabel\" role=\"switch\" switch>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchMdLabel\">Default switch</label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"theme-colors","type":"heading","en":"Theme colors","level":2},{"id":"theme-colors--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Modify the appearance of switches by adding the <code>.theme-{color}</code> class to the <code>.switch</code> element. This will set the checked background and border color to the theme color."},{"id":"theme-colors--example-1","type":"demo","key":"f8ef0dd3ff95a38d4dd1","height":300,"anchors":["switchprimary","switchaccent","switchsuccess","switchdanger","switchwarning","switchinfo","switchinverse","switchsecondary"]},{"id":"theme-colors--code-1","type":"code","value":" <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-primary\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchprimary\" role=\"switch\" switch checked>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchprimary\">Example primary switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-accent\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchaccent\" role=\"switch\" switch checked>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchaccent\">Example accent switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-success\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchsuccess\" role=\"switch\" switch checked>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchsuccess\">Example success switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-danger\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchdanger\" role=\"switch\" switch checked>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchdanger\">Example danger switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-warning\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchwarning\" role=\"switch\" switch checked>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchwarning\">Example warning switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-info\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchinfo\" role=\"switch\" switch checked>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchinfo\">Example info switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-inverse\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchinverse\" role=\"switch\" switch checked>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchinverse\">Example inverse switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-secondary\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchsecondary\" role=\"switch\" switch checked>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchsecondary\">Example secondary switch</label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"disabled","type":"heading","en":"Disabled","level":2},{"id":"disabled--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add the <code>disabled</code> attribute and the associated <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>s are automatically styled to match with a lighter color to help indicate the input’s state."},{"id":"disabled--example-1","type":"demo","key":"7de9e06db4be82c34cf3","height":174,"anchors":["switchDisabledLabel","switchCheckedDisabledLabel"]},{"id":"disabled--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchDisabledLabel\" role=\"switch\" switch disabled>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchDisabledLabel\">Disabled switch</label>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchCheckedDisabledLabel\" role=\"switch\" switch disabled checked>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchCheckedDisabledLabel\">Disabled checked switch</label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"sizes","type":"heading","en":"Sizes","level":2},{"id":"sizes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add a size modifier class to make your switch appear smaller or larger."},{"id":"sizes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"68e9266879c6370d2121","height":201,"anchors":["switchSizeSm","switchSizeMd","switchSizeLg"]},{"id":"sizes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch switch-sm\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchSizeSm\" role=\"switch\" switch>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchSizeSm\">Small switch</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchSizeMd\" role=\"switch\" switch>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchSizeMd\">Default switch</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch switch-lg\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchSizeLg\" role=\"switch\" switch>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchSizeLg\">Large switch</label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"custom-width","type":"heading","en":"Custom width","level":2},{"id":"custom-width--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Customize your switch for any width and indicator size you need by overriding the CSS variables. For example, for a more modern look, you could widen the switch and indicator."},{"id":"custom-width--example-1","type":"demo","key":"1e36dd978d863e06c718","height":147,"anchors":["switchCustomWidth"]},{"id":"custom-width--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\" style=\"--bs-switch-width: 2.75rem; --bs-switch-indicator-width: 1.5rem;\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchCustomWidth\" role=\"switch\" switch>\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchCustomWidth\">Custom width switch</label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$switch-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --switch-height: 1.25rem,\n    --switch-width: calc(var(--switch-height) * 1.75),\n    --switch-padding: .0625rem,\n    --switch-margin-block: .125rem,\n    // Share the form-control motion tokens so switch, checkbox, and radio move\n    // in sync; the overshoot (\"back\") easing makes the thumb bounce as it settles.\n    --switch-transition-duration: var(--control-transition-duration),\n    --switch-transition-timing: var(--control-transition-timing),\n    --switch-bg: var(--bg-3),\n    --switch-border-width: var(--border-width),\n    --switch-border-color: var(--border-color),\n    --switch-indicator-bg: var(--white),\n    --switch-indicator-width: calc(var(--switch-height) - calc(var(--switch-padding) * 2) - var(--switch-border-width) * 2),\n    --switch-indicator-height: calc(var(--switch-height) - calc(var(--switch-padding) * 2) - var(--switch-border-width) * 2),\n    --switch-checked-bg: var(--control-checked-bg),\n    --switch-checked-border-color: var(--switch-checked-bg),\n    --switch-checked-indicator-bg: var(--white),\n    --switch-disabled-bg: var(--control-disabled-bg),\n    --switch-disabled-indicator-bg: var(--fg-3),\n  ),\n  $switch-tokens\n);","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"e1c722c4d2555c6841a9","html":"<div class=\"switch\">\n  <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switch\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"675800f1061b42b027b3","html":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchMdLabel\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchMdLabel\">Default switch</label>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex flex-column gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"f8ef0dd3ff95a38d4dd1","html":" <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-primary\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchprimary\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" checked=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchprimary\">Example primary switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-accent\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchaccent\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" checked=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchaccent\">Example accent switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-success\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchsuccess\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" checked=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchsuccess\">Example success switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-danger\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchdanger\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" checked=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchdanger\">Example danger switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-warning\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchwarning\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" checked=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchwarning\">Example warning switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-info\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchinfo\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" checked=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchinfo\">Example info switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-inverse\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchinverse\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" checked=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchinverse\">Example inverse switch</label>\n</div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch theme-secondary\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchsecondary\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" checked=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchsecondary\">Example secondary switch</label>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex flex-column gap-2"},"sprite":""},{"key":"7de9e06db4be82c34cf3","html":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchDisabledLabel\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" disabled=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchDisabledLabel\">Disabled switch</label>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchCheckedDisabledLabel\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchCheckedDisabledLabel\">Disabled checked switch</label>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-2"},"sprite":""},{"key":"68e9266879c6370d2121","html":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch switch-sm\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchSizeSm\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchSizeSm\">Small switch</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchSizeMd\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchSizeMd\">Default switch</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch switch-lg\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchSizeLg\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchSizeLg\">Large switch</label>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex flex-column gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"1e36dd978d863e06c718","html":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"switch\" style=\"--bs-switch-width: 2.75rem; --bs-switch-indicator-width: 1.5rem;\"><!--[!code highlight]-->\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"switchCustomWidth\" role=\"switch\" switch=\"\">\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"switchCustomWidth\">Custom width switch</label>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex flex-column gap-3"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Install","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/install"},{"en":"AI","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/ai"},{"en":"Approach","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/approach"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/css-variables"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/accessibility"},{"en":"Quickstart","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/quickstart"},{"en":"npm","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/npm"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/parcel"},{"en":"Vite